(hook) start
kagebunshin: this folder is in project app, registered with kagebunshin. Its secrets come from kagebunshin, not from a .env file: run commands that need them as `kagebunshin run -- COMMAND` (`--env ENV` for another environment). Writing a .env file here is refused. The kagebunshin skill has the rest. It has not been shown to work yet: run `kagebunshin next` and do what it says.
